      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.4,
      "end_seconds": 24.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "I wanted to get pain in both knees looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.98,
      "end_seconds": 28.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.53,
      "end_seconds": 36.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.77,
      "end_seconds": 47.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.74,
      "end_seconds": 52.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I've had it for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.15,
      "end_seconds": 57.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Okay, how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.25,
      "end_seconds": 59.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.42,
      "end_seconds": 67.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "have you had any pain in other joints, back pain or redness over the knee?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.65,
      "end_seconds": 75.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "No, no pain in other joints, back pain or redness over the knee."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.3,
      "end_seconds": 78.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Did you notice any fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.85,
      "end_seconds": 81.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No. No fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.08,
      "end_seconds": 85.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.09,
      "end_seconds": 88.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.23,
      "end_seconds": 104.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.85,
      "end_seconds": 127.95,
      "duration_seconds": 22.1,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. My husband and I live above the shop. I hardly move around during the day. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.25,
      "end_seconds": 145.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.89,
      "end_seconds": 148.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 150.35,
      "end_seconds": 162.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 111 over 72, pulse is 85 beats a minute, temperature is 36.8 degrees, saturation 98 percent, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.15,
      "end_seconds": 165.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.0,
      "end_seconds": 170.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.37,
      "end_seconds": 184.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.92,
      "end_seconds": 188.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.67,
      "end_seconds": 203.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "there's mild swelling on the right knee, and a grating feel when I bend it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.89,
      "end_seconds": 206.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.95,
      "end_seconds": 226.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Bending is limited to about a right angle, and it hurts at the end."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.41,
      "end_seconds": 232.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.62,
      "end_seconds": 264.98,
      "duration_seconds": 30.36,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Taking everything into account, it points towards osteoarthritis of the knees. I want an X-ray of both knees done, that's for knee pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for joint pain. I'm prescribing paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for two weeks. It's for knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.06,
      "end_seconds": 267.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "mm, alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.08,
      "end_seconds": 298.79,
      "duration_seconds": 29.71,
      "text": "losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us i'll also refer you to physiotherapy one warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse in that case don't wait i'll want another look in six weeks what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.62,
      "end_seconds": 310.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.57,
      "end_seconds": 317.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.07,
      "end_seconds": 321.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
